cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or its PCCF (Presence-Conditioned Conformal
  Fusion) research components, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "REDACT: PII/PHI Detection and Anonymization for Security Telemetry"
abstract: >-
  PII/PHI detection and anonymization for heterogeneous security telemetry.
  A three-layer detection ensemble (regex, Microsoft Presidio NER, Shannon
  entropy) sits behind a taxonomy-driven anonymization router (redaction,
  keyed pseudonymization, reversible tokenization) and a field-level drift
  detector. Includes PCCF (Presence-Conditioned Conformal Fusion), a
  per-group conformal calibration method for multi-layer PII candidate
  fusion, validated across phases 1-11 on synthetic and real documents
  (TAB, BTC, WNUT-17, GermEval, FactRuEval, ANERcorp, MEDDOCAN, and more).
authors:
